#!/usr/bin/env etcs
# A HOLDER: a node at the origin that draws nothing itself and holds what is
# put in it -- anchored, so when nothing in it changes it is still, skipped
# by the interaction and drawn as one mesh (ontology/CausalBase.h, A STILL
# SUBTREE; Scene3D, a still container's picture). At the origin, so what is
# in it is placed in the world's own frame.
#   run kart_holder.etcs holder=<Scene3D>
requires holder [Drawable3D]
holder.Create(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)
holder.SetAnchored(1)
holder.SetVisible(0)
